   "html": "<section class=\"c-action-title-slide\" aria-label=\"Slide 7: closing the smallest depot cuts fixed cost\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Depot network review · Cost</p>\n    <h1>Closing the smallest depot cuts fixed cost by a fifth, provided routes are redrawn first</h1>\n    <ul class=\"points\">\n      <li class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n        <h2>The saving is real</h2>\n        <p>Rent, utilities and supervision at the smallest site come to 19% of fixed cost, about €410k a year.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n        <h2>Capacity is not the constraint</h2>\n        <p>The two remaining depots can absorb the stock without new racking, peaking at 88% of floor space.</p>\n      </li>\n      <li class=\"point\">\n        <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n        <h2>Routes are the constraint</h2>\n        <p>Without a redesign, the longest runs grow by 40 minutes and the last drop misses its window.</p>\n      </li>\n    </ul>\n    <div class=\"take\"><b>Takeaway</b><span>Fund the six-week route study now; decide on the move in January.</span></div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">\n      <span>Source: finance ledger FY2026, route simulation October 2026. Illustrative figures.</span>\n      <span class=\"page\">7</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-action-title-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr auto auto;\n  padding: 4.6cqi 6cqi 3cqi;\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 1.3cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-action-title-slide h1 {\n  margin: 1.2cqi 0 0;\n  max-width: 76cqi;\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 3.2cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 1.12;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  text-wrap: balance;\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .points {\n  align-self: center;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 3.4cqi;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .point { padding-top: 1.6cqi; border-top: var(--ds-stroke) solid var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-action-title-slide .num { display: block; margin: 0 0 0.9cqi; font-size: 1.2cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n.c-action-title-slide h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.9cqi; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--ds-ink); }\n.c-action-title-slide .point p { margin: 0.9cqi 0 0; font-size: 1.5cqi; line-height: 1.5; }\n.c-action-title-slide .take {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 1.6cqi;\n  padding: 1.5cqi 2cqi;\n  background: var(--ds-highlight-fill);\n  box-shadow: inset 0.35cqi 0 0 var(--ds-highlight-line);\n  border-radius: calc(0.6cqi * var(--ds-radius-scale, 1));\n  font-size: 1.6cqi;\n  line-height: 1.35;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .take b { flex: none; font-size: 1.2cqi; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-action-title-slide .take span { font-weight: 600; }\n.c-action-title-slide .foot {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  gap: 3cqi;\n  margin-top: 1.6cqi;\n  font-size: 1.1cqi;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}\n.c-action-title-slide .page { flex: none; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }",
   "js": ""
