   "html": "<section class=\"c-big-number-slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">Onboarding</div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">62<span>%</span></div>\n      <p class=\"context\">of new accounts that stop using the product do so <b>within the first three screens</b>, before they ever see a result.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"foot\">Source: internal product analytics, January to September 2026, 48,200 new accounts.</div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
   "css": ".c-big-number-slide {\n  container-type: inline-size;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: var(--ds-surface);\n  color: var(--ds-text);\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);\n}\n.c-big-number-slide .inner {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;\n  padding: 6cqi 7cqi;\n}\n.c-big-number-slide .eyebrow { font-size: 1.5cqi; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-big-number-slide .main { align-self: center; display: grid; gap: 2.2cqi; padding: 1cqi 0; }\n.c-big-number-slide .figure {\n  font-family: var(--ds-font-display);\n  font-size: 23cqi;\n  font-weight: var(--ds-weight-display);\n  letter-spacing: var(--ds-tracking-display);\n  line-height: 0.88;\n  color: var(--ds-ink);\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.c-big-number-slide .figure span { font-size: 0.5em; margin-left: 0.04em; color: var(--ds-muted); }\n.c-big-number-slide .context { margin: 0; max-width: 64cqi; font-size: 2.5cqi; line-height: 1.38; color: var(--ds-text); }\n.c-big-number-slide .context b { color: var(--ds-ink); font-weight: 700; }\n.c-big-number-slide .foot {\n  padding-top: 1.8cqi;\n  border-top: var(--ds-hairline) solid var(--ds-line);\n  font-size: 1.3cqi;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  color: var(--ds-muted);\n}",
