   "html": "<table class=\"c-notification\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" bgcolor=\"var(--ds-panel)\" style='background: var(--ds-panel); font-family: var(--ds-font-sans);'>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" style='padding: 40px 16px;'>\n      <div style='display: none; max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; opacity: 0; font-size: 1px; color: var(--ds-panel);'>Your card was declined. Update it by 3 November to keep your plan.</div>\n      <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style='width: 100%; max-width: 600px;'>\n        <tr>\n          <td style='padding: 0 8px 16px 8px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); font-weight: 700; color: var(--ds-ink);'>Fieldwork Billing</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td bgcolor=\"var(--ds-surface)\" style='background: var(--ds-surface); border: 1px solid var(--ds-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-xl);'>\n            <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\n              <tr>\n                <td style='padding: 32px 40px 0 40px;'>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n                    <td bgcolor=\"var(--ds-danger-fill)\" style='background: var(--ds-danger-fill); border: 1.5px solid var(--ds-danger-line); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-md); padding: 12px 16px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); font-weight: 700; line-height: 20px; color: var(--ds-ink);'>Action needed by 3 November</td>\n                  </tr></table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style='padding: 24px 40px 8px 40px; font-family: var(--ds-font-display); font-size: 26px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--ds-ink);'>We could not charge your card.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style='padding: 0 40px 24px 40px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-md); line-height: 26px; color: var(--ds-text);'>The payment of $29.00 for your Team plan was declined by your bank. Nothing has changed yet, but your workspace switches to read-only if the card is not updated within three days.</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style='padding: 0 40px 24px 40px;'>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"var(--ds-action)\" style='background: var(--ds-action); border-radius: var(--ds-radius-md);'>\n                      <a href=\"#\" style='display: inline-block; padding: 16px 32px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-md); font-weight: 700; line-height: 20px; color: var(--ds-on-action); text-decoration: none;'>Update payment method</a>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr></table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td style='padding: 0 40px 40px 40px;'>\n                  <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\"><tr>\n                    <td style='border-top: 1px solid var(--ds-line); padding-top: 20px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-sm); line-height: 22px; color: var(--ds-muted);'>\n                      Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:<br>\n                      <span style='font-family: var(--ds-font-mono); font-size: var(--ds-text-xs); color: var(--ds-text); word-break: break-all;'>https://example.com/billing/update-card</span>\n                    </td>\n                  </tr></table>\n                </td>\n              </tr>\n\n            </table>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td align=\"center\" style='padding: 24px 16px 0 16px; font-family: var(--ds-font-sans); font-size: var(--ds-text-xs); line-height: 20px; color: var(--ds-muted);'>\n            Did not expect this? Reply to this email and we will look into it.<br>\n            Fieldwork Studio, 22 Canal Street, Harrowgate.\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
