   "html": "<article class=\"c-carousel-end\" aria-label=\"Closing carousel slide\">\n  <div class=\"inner\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">That is the stack</span>\n      <span class=\"count\">07<span>/07</span></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"main\">\n      <h2>One tool a week, no fluff.</h2>\n      <p class=\"sub\">I test the apps so you do not have to. New slides every Tuesday.</p>\n      <span class=\"follow\">Follow @yourhandle</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cues\">\n      <span class=\"cue\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 3h12v18l-6-4.5L6 21z\"/></svg>\n        Save this for your next tool audit\n      </span>\n      <span class=\"cue\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 3L10 14M21 3l-7 18-4-7-7-4z\"/></svg>\n        Send it to someone drowning in tabs\n      </span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
